{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015UfX2QJLPhkLp1HnjXU7BA","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t// Copyright (c) 2026 Petar Djukic. All rights reserved.\n2\t// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n3\t\n4\tpackage main\n5\t\n6\tfunc reverseSlice(s []string) {\n7\t\tfor i, j := 0, len(s)-1; i < j; i, j = i+1, j-1 {\n8\t\t\ts[i], s[j] = s[j], s[i]\n9\t\t}\n10\t}\n11\t\n12\tfunc strverscmp(a, b string) int {\n13\t\ti, j := 0, 0\n14\t\tfor i < len(a) && j < len(b) {\n15\t\t\tca, cb := a[i], b[j]\n16\t\t\tif isDigit(ca) && isDigit(cb) {\n17\t\t\t\tcmp := compareDigitRun(a, b, &i, &j)\n18\t\t\t\tif cmp != 0 {\n19\t\t\t\t\treturn cmp\n20\t\t\t\t}\n21\t\t\t\tcontinue\n22\t\t\t}\n23\t\t\tif ca != cb {\n24\t\t\t\treturn int(ca) - int(cb)\n25\t\t\t}\n26\t\t\ti++\n27\t\t\tj++\n28\t\t}\n29\t\treturn len(a) - len(b)\n30\t}\n31\t\n32\tfunc compareDigitRun(a, b string, i, j *int) int {\n33\t\tif a[*i] == '0' || b[*j] == '0' {\n34\t\t\treturn compareLeadingZeros(a, b, i, j)\n35\t\t}\n36\t\treturn compareNumeric(a, b, i, j)\n37\t}\n38\t\n39\tfunc compareLeadingZeros(a, b string, i, j *int) int {\n40\t\tfor *i < len(a) && *j < len(b) {\n41\t\t\tca, cb := a[*i], b[*j]\n42\t\t\taDigit, bDigit := isDigit(ca), isDigit(cb)\n43\t\t\tif !aDigit && !bDigit {\n44\t\t\t\treturn 0\n45\t\t\t}\n46\t\t\tif !aDigit {\n47\t\t\t\treturn -1\n48\t\t\t}\n49\t\t\tif !bDigit {\n50\t\t\t\treturn 1\n51\t\t\t}\n52\t\t\tif ca != cb {\n53\t\t\t\treturn int(ca) - int(cb)\n54\t\t\t}\n55\t\t\t*i++\n56\t\t\t*j++\n57\t\t}\n58\t\tif *i < len(a) && isDigit(a[*i]) {\n59\t\t\treturn 1\n60\t\t}\n61\t\tif *j < len(b) && isDigit(b[*j]) {\n62\t\t\treturn -1\n63\t\t}\n64\t\treturn 0\n65\t}\n66\t\n67\tfunc compareNumeric(a, b string, i, j *int) int {\n68\t\tai, aj := *i, *j\n69\t\tfor ai < len(a) && isDigit(a[ai]) {\n70\t\t\tai++\n71\t\t}\n72\t\tfor aj < len(b) && isDigit(b[aj]) {\n73\t\t\taj++\n74\t\t}\n75\t\tlenA, lenB := ai-*i, aj-*j\n76\t\tif lenA != lenB {\n77\t\t\t*i = ai\n78\t\t\t*j = aj\n79\t\t\treturn lenA - lenB\n80\t\t}\n81\t\tfor *i < ai {\n82\t\t\tif a[*i] != b[*j] {\n83\t\t\t\tresult := int(a[*i]) - int(b[*j])\n84\t\t\t\t*i = ai\n85\t\t\t\t*j = aj\n86\t\t\t\treturn result\n87\t\t\t}\n88\t\t\t*i++\n89\t\t\t*j++\n90\t\t}\n91\t\treturn 0\n92\t}\n93\t\n94\tfunc isDigit(c byte) bool {\n95\t\treturn c >= '0' && c <= '9'\n96\t}\n97\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NAzEhJjaum4DxdYeAD6g4H","session_id":"6949b217-412c-4560-bd4a-9e3e6a1dfd95","uuid":"a24fe6f5-8112-4be9-a53c-0c1104a5efdb","timestamp":"2026-05-14T22:08:46.584Z"}
