{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NAzEhJjaum4DxdYeAD6g4H","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I have found all the requested functions. Here's the complete summary:\n\n## Functions in `pkg/format/color.go`\n\n**FileTypeColor:**\n```go\nfunc FileTypeColor(mode os.FileMode) string {\n\tif colorDisabled() {\n\t\treturn \"\"\n\t}\n\tswitch {\n\tcase mode&os.ModeDir != 0:\n\t\treturn ansiDir\n\tcase mode&os.ModeSymlink != 0:\n\t\treturn ansiSymlink\n\tcase mode&os.ModeNamedPipe != 0:\n\t\treturn ansiFifo\n\tcase mode&os.ModeSocket != 0:\n\t\treturn ansiSocket\n\tcase mode&os.ModeDevice != 0 && mode&os.ModeCharDevice != 0:\n\t\treturn ansiCharDev\n\tcase mode&os.ModeDevice != 0:\n\t\treturn ansiBlockDev\n\tcase mode&0o111 != 0:\n\t\treturn ansiExec\n\tdefault:\n\t\treturn \"\"\n\t}\n}\n```\n\n**Reset:**\n```go\nfunc Reset() string {\n\tif colorDisabled() {\n\t\treturn \"\"\n\t}\n\treturn ansiReset\n}\n```\n\n**SetColorEnabled:**\n```go\nfunc SetColorEnabled(enabled bool) {\n\tcolorMu.Lock()\n\tcolorOverride = &enabled\n\tcolorMu.Unlock()\n}\n```\n\n**ColorEnabled:**\n```go\nfunc ColorEnabled(w io.Writer) bool {\n\tcolorMu.RLock()\n\toverride := colorOverride\n\tcolorMu.RUnlock()\n\tif override != nil {\n\t\treturn *override\n\t}\n\ttype fder interface {\n\t\tFd() uintptr\n\t}\n\tif f, ok := w.(fder); ok {\n\t\treturn sys.IsTerminal(f.Fd())\n\t}\n\treturn false\n}\n```\n\n**ResetColorEnabled:**\n```go\nfunc ResetColorEnabled() {\n\tcolorMu.Lock()\n\tcolorOverride = nil\n\tcolorMu.Unlock()\n}\n```\n\n## Functions in `cmd/ls/version.go`\n\n**reverseSlice:**\n```go\nfunc reverseSlice(s []string) {\n\tfor i, j := 0, len(s)-1; i < j; i, j = i+1, j-1 {\n\t\ts[i], s[j] = s[j], s[i]\n\t}\n}\n```\n\n**strverscmp:**\n```go\nfunc strverscmp(a, b string) int {\n\ti, j := 0, 0\n\tfor i < len(a) && j < len(b) {\n\t\tca, cb := a[i], b[j]\n\t\tif isDigit(ca) && isDigit(cb) {\n\t\t\tcmp := compareDigitRun(a, b, &i, &j)\n\t\t\tif cmp != 0 {\n\t\t\t\treturn cmp\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tcontinue\n\t\t}\n\t\tif ca != cb {\n\t\t\treturn int(ca) - int(cb)\n\t\t}\n\t\ti++\n\t\tj++\n\t}\n\treturn len(a) - len(b)\n}\n```\n\nAll requested functions are defined in:\n- `/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5217/pkg/format/color.go`\n- `/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5217/cmd/ls/version.go`"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6949b217-412c-4560-bd4a-9e3e6a1dfd95","uuid":"73373ca9-f3f8-4494-8640-9d6783473849","timestamp":"2026-05-14T22:08:52.673Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In the repo at /private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5217, find and show me the signatures/implementations of these functions in the `pkg/format` package:\n- FileTypeColor\n- Reset\n- SetColorEnabled\n- ColorEnabled\n- ResetColorEnabled\n\nAlso check if there's a `reverseSlice` function and `strverscmp` function defined somewhere in cmd/ls/. Show the actual code for all of these.","agentId":"a15a3f17c84862efa","agentType":"Explore","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I have found all the requested functions. Here's the complete summary:\n\n## Functions in `pkg/format/color.go`\n\n**FileTypeColor:**\n```go\nfunc FileTypeColor(mode os.FileMode) string {\n\tif colorDisabled() {\n\t\treturn \"\"\n\t}\n\tswitch {\n\tcase mode&os.ModeDir != 0:\n\t\treturn ansiDir\n\tcase mode&os.ModeSymlink != 0:\n\t\treturn ansiSymlink\n\tcase mode&os.ModeNamedPipe != 0:\n\t\treturn ansiFifo\n\tcase mode&os.ModeSocket != 0:\n\t\treturn ansiSocket\n\tcase mode&os.ModeDevice != 0 && mode&os.ModeCharDevice != 0:\n\t\treturn ansiCharDev\n\tcase mode&os.ModeDevice != 0:\n\t\treturn ansiBlockDev\n\tcase mode&0o111 != 0:\n\t\treturn ansiExec\n\tdefault:\n\t\treturn \"\"\n\t}\n}\n```\n\n**Reset:**\n```go\nfunc Reset() string {\n\tif colorDisabled() {\n\t\treturn \"\"\n\t}\n\treturn ansiReset\n}\n```\n\n**SetColorEnabled:**\n```go\nfunc SetColorEnabled(enabled bool) {\n\tcolorMu.Lock()\n\tcolorOverride = &enabled\n\tcolorMu.Unlock()\n}\n```\n\n**ColorEnabled:**\n```go\nfunc ColorEnabled(w io.Writer) bool {\n\tcolorMu.RLock()\n\toverride := colorOverride\n\tcolorMu.RUnlock()\n\tif override != nil {\n\t\treturn *override\n\t}\n\ttype fder interface {\n\t\tFd() uintptr\n\t}\n\tif f, ok := w.(fder); ok {\n\t\treturn sys.IsTerminal(f.Fd())\n\t}\n\treturn false\n}\n```\n\n**ResetColorEnabled:**\n```go\nfunc ResetColorEnabled() {\n\tcolorMu.Lock()\n\tcolorOverride = nil\n\tcolorMu.Unlock()\n}\n```\n\n## Functions in `cmd/ls/version.go`\n\n**reverseSlice:**\n```go\nfunc reverseSlice(s []string) {\n\tfor i, j := 0, len(s)-1; i < j; i, j = i+1, j-1 {\n\t\ts[i], s[j] = s[j], s[i]\n\t}\n}\n```\n\n**strverscmp:**\n```go\nfunc strverscmp(a, b string) int {\n\ti, j := 0, 0\n\tfor i < len(a) && j < len(b) {\n\t\tca, cb := a[i], b[j]\n\t\tif isDigit(ca) && isDigit(cb) {\n\t\t\tcmp := compareDigitRun(a, b, &i, &j)\n\t\t\tif cmp != 0 {\n\t\t\t\treturn cmp\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tcontinue\n\t\t}\n\t\tif ca != cb {\n\t\t\treturn int(ca) - int(cb)\n\t\t}\n\t\ti++\n\t\tj++\n\t}\n\treturn len(a) - len(b)\n}\n```\n\nAll requested functions are defined in:\n- `/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5217/pkg/format/color.go`\n- `/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5217/cmd/ls/version.go`"}],"totalDurationMs":15128,"totalTokens":21448,"totalToolUseCount":6,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1163,"cache_read_input_tokens":19386,"output_tokens":893,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1163},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":893,"cache_read_input_tokens":19386,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1163,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_